cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Cross-cohort gut microbiome classification of colorectal cancer: a 10-cohort meta-analysis"
abstract: >-
  Country-aware leave-one-dataset-out (LODO) meta-analysis of gut shotgun
  metagenomes from 10 colorectal cancer cohorts (n = 1,522 subjects),
  showing that species-only Random Forest classifiers significantly
  outperform joint species-plus-pathway models for CRC detection across
  cohorts.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-05-18"
license: MIT
